---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Ice Hockey Shifts: Terms"
  description="Terms of use for the Ice Hockey Shifts iPhone app."
  alternate="/fr/iceshifts/conditions/">
  <section class="top narrow prose">
    <p class="meta kicker">Ice Hockey Shifts</p>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated 2026-11-16 · <a href="/fr/iceshifts/conditions/" hreflang="fr">Français</a></p>

    <p>These terms cover the Ice Hockey Shifts phone app and its optional account service, made by Matthew
    Macri, an individual developer in Montréal, Québec. By using the app you accept them. If you got the app
    from the App Store, Apple's standard licence agreement for apps also applies.</p>

    <h2>The app</h2>
    <p>The app is free. It shows games recorded with the Ice Hockey Shifts watch app: shifts, ice time and
    heart rate. The watch records; the phone only reads. You may use the app for your own, personal
    purposes.</p>

    <h2>Your account</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>An account is optional. You can sign in with Apple, Google, or an email address and password.</li>
      <li>Keep your password to yourself. You are responsible for what is done with your account.</li>
      <li>Accounts are meant for people 14 and older; a younger player needs a parent's consent.</li>
      <li>You can delete your account at any time in the app (Settings, Account, Delete account).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your games</h2>
    <p>Your games and answers stay yours. We keep them only to show them to you and keep them in step between
    your phones, as the <a href="/iceshifts/privacy/">privacy policy</a> explains. We do not sell them or
    share them.</p>

    <h2>Fair use</h2>
    <p>Don't try to break, overload or get into the server or other people's accounts, and don't use the
    service to send anything that isn't a game. An account that does may be suspended or closed.</p>

    <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
    <p>Heart-rate figures come from a wrist sensor and are estimates, shown for training interest only. The
    app is not a medical device. If you have a health concern, see a doctor.</p>

    <h2>No guarantee</h2>
    <p>The app and the service are provided as they are, by one developer. We work to keep them running and
    accurate, but can't promise they will always be available or free of errors, and the service may change
    or end. If it ends, you will be told in advance in the app, and the games on your phone stay on your
    phone. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under the law where you live, including Québec's
    Consumer Protection Act.</p>

    <h2>Garmin, Apple and Google</h2>
    <p>Garmin, Garmin Connect, Apple and Google are trademarks of their owners. This app is not made or
    endorsed by them, and their own terms apply to their services.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If these terms change, the new version will be posted on this page with a new date.</p>

    <h2>Law and contact</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Québec and of Canada. Questions:
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
